        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022830/extras/ede4a4775ddc5eeff9b157f1deb6ce15.poster.avif?t=1759550938\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022830/extras/ede4a4775ddc5eeff9b157f1deb6ce15.webm?t=1759550938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022830/extras/ede4a4775ddc5eeff9b157f1deb6ce15.mp4?t=1759550938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORYLINE</strong><br><i>You take the role of Jake, who receives a call from his worried mother about your missing sister. What begins as a simple search quickly turns into a nightmare inside a haunted apartment complex, one that hides dark secrets and a history of dark rituals.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Average time to complete the game: 10-30 minutes</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Checkpoints or Saves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension: </strong><i>Encounter psychological horror elements that will keep you on the edge of your seat. </i> <br><strong>Mystery: </strong><i>Unravel the truth of what happened, by searching the environment for evidence.</i><br><strong>Graphics:</strong><i> Using Unreal Engine 5, you get to enjoy high resolution gameplay</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The gameplay is closer to realism;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Walking Simulator / Horror genre;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find out what happened to the main character's sister</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore a rundown apartment complex, and apartment with hidden secrets to find the truth</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy atmosphere </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022830/extras/020e7c08ba44288c78e63817cfd923a3.poster.avif?t=1759550938\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022830/extras/020e7c08ba44288c78e63817cfd923a3.webm?t=1759550938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022830/extras/020e7c08ba44288c78e63817cfd923a3.mp4?t=1759550938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Inventory System</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022830/extras/9d519527cbbf51585cdbd4f3caa29a01.poster.avif?t=1759550938\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022830/extras/9d519527cbbf51585cdbd4f3caa29a01.webm?t=1759550938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022830/extras/9d519527cbbf51585cdbd4f3caa29a01.mp4?t=1759550938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Interactive environment</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022830/extras/5b153a0e6d96d16650d1d02d2c79978c.poster.avif?t=1759550938\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022830/extras/5b153a0e6d96d16650d1d02d2c79978c.webm?t=1759550938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022830/extras/5b153a0e6d96d16650d1d02d2c79978c.mp4?t=1759550938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Use interactable items to solve puzzles, and find clues</i></p>",
